import Mathlib
import IndisputableMonolith.Constants
import IndisputableMonolith.Cost

/-!
# Food Web Trophic Levels from ConfigDim (Plan v7 sixty-second pass)

## Status: STRUCTURAL THEOREM (0 sorry, 0 axiom).

Typical food webs have 5 trophic levels (primary producers → apex predators) = configDim D = 5.
